e"},{"start":70.8,"duration":7.04,"text":"and has equal access to information,"},{"start":73.8,"duration":6.56,"text":"services, and opportunities."},{"start":77.84,"duration":6.36,"text":"And I hope that you have heard about the"},{"start":80.36,"duration":5.44,"text":"WCAG. It's uh Web Content Accessibility"},{"start":84.2,"duration":6.08,"text":"Guidelines"},{"start":85.8,"duration":7.88,"text":"and they are published by the W3C."},{"start":90.28,"duration":6.36,"text":"Uh they're standard and these guidelines"},{"start":93.68,"duration":7.32,"text":"explain how to make web content more"},{"start":96.64,"duration":7.44,"text":"accessible to people with disabilities."},{"start":101.0,"duration":5.52,"text":"And a lot of countries have adopted"},{"start":104.08,"duration":5.16,"text":"these guidelines into their laws and"},{"start":106.52,"duration":6.0,"text":"regulations aiming to create inclusive"},{"start":109.24,"duration":3.28,"text":"digital society."},{"start":112.88,"duration":4.52,"text":"And also another thing that we will"},{"start":114.92,"duration":4.6,"text":"mention after in"},{"start":117.4,"duration":5.16,"text":"in the presentation is area. It's"},{"start":119.52,"duration":4.48,"text":"accessible rich internet application."},{"start":122.56,"duration":4.48,"text":"It's also"},{"start":124.0,"duration":5.88,"text":"developed by W3C"},{"start":127.04,"duration":6.52,"text":"and is a set of rules and attributes"},{"start":129.88,"duration":5.52,"text":"that define ways to make web content and"},{"start":133.56,"duration":3.76,"text":"web applications"},{"start":135.4,"duration":3.76,"text":"more accessible to people with"},{"start":137.32,"duration":5.36,"text":"accessibility, especially those"},{"start":139.16,"duration":6.72,"text":"developed with JavaScript."},{"start":142.68,"duration":6.0,"text":"And here the story."},{"start":145.88,"duration":5.44,"text":"You ask your AI assistant to fix an"},{"start":148.68,"duration":4.52,"text":"accessibility issue."},{"start":151.32,"duration":3.56,"text":"And it gives you code that looks"},{"start":153.2,"duration":4.8,"text":"perfect."},{"start":154.88,"duration":6.8,"text":"Runs without errors and even sites one"},{"start":158.0,"duration":5.48,"text":"of these the weak access criteria."},{"start":161.68,"duration":5.28,"text":"And you trusted it."},{"start":163.48,"duration":6.2,"text":"It sounds so certain, specific, and"},{"start":166.96,"duration":4.84,"text":"confident. Of course you did. Why"},{"start":169.68,"duration":5.2,"text":"wouldn't you?"},{"start":171.8,"duration":4.36,"text":"And you accept the change."},{"start":174.88,"duration":4.64,"text":"And here"},{"start":176.16,"duration":6.64,"text":"then it comes, the trap."},{"start":179.52,"duration":6.4,"text":"Probably your QA team reports that"},{"start":182.8,"duration":6.32,"text":"keyboard users are now trapped into into"},{"start":185.92,"duration":4.4,"text":"your login or navigation menu. They can"},{"start":189.12,"duration":3.4,"text":"tap in"},{"start":190.32,"duration":3.92,"text":"but can't tap out."},{"start":192.52,"duration":4.6,"text":"And"},{"start":194.24,"duration":5.52,"text":"you know, you didn't have you didn't had"},{"start":197.12,"duration":5.24,"text":"any errors. Actually, all checks were"},{"start":199.76,"duration":2.6,"text":"passed."},{"start":202.52,"duration":4.96,"text":"So, I can give you"},{"start":205.0,"duration":4.28,"text":"five key take takeaways from this"},{"start":207.48,"duration":3.28,"text":"presentation."},{"start":209.28,"duration":3.84,"text":"First,"},{"start":210.76,"duration":5.24,"text":"AI could hallucinate these the weak"},{"start":213.12,"duration":5.36,"text":"access success criteria. Yes, the models"},{"start":216.0,"duration":6.12,"text":"are better now than it"},{"start":218.48,"duration":8.12,"text":"they were before, but it's always good"},{"start":222.12,"duration":7.48,"text":"to verify citations again official W3C"},{"start":226.6,"duration":3.0,"text":"documentation."},{"start":230.12,"duration":5.64,"text":"AI fixes could create new accessibility"},{"start":233.0,"duration":6.92,"text":"problems. So, that's why it's important"},{"start":235.76,"duration":6.24,"text":"to test the full interaction, not just"},{"start":239.92,"duration":3.56,"text":"isolated issue."},{"start":242.0,"duration":2.32,"text":"And"},{"start":243.48,"duration":2.48,"text":"um"},{"start":244.32,"duration":4.52,"text":"What Aim"},{"start":245.96,"duration":6.96,"text":"Uh they produced a report every year."},{"start":248.84,"duration":7.6,"text":"It's a non-profit organization. So, they"},{"start":252.92,"duration":5.4,"text":"they produced a WebAIM Million, a report"},{"start":256.44,"duration":3.88,"text":"on the accessibility of the top 1"},{"start":258.32,"duration":5.88,"text":"million homepages."},{"start":260.32,"duration":6.88,"text":"And according to this report this year,"},{"start":264.2,"duration":3.0,"text":"95.9%"},{"start":267.36,"duration":6.12,"text":"of these homepages"},{"start":269.2,"duration":7.4,"text":"had detected WCAG 2.0 failures. And"},{"start":273.48,"duration":7.4,"text":"these numbers actually increased"},{"start":276.6,"duration":4.28,"text":"um from 94.8%"},{"start":281.04,"duration":5.12,"text":"from 2025."},{"start":283.0,"duration":5.48,"text":"So, you know why? Because of the AI."},{"start":286.16,"duration":7.48,"text":"Because the models that we are using,"},{"start":288.48,"duration":6.8,"text":"they are trained on this data, which is"},{"start":293.64,"duration":4.16,"text":"95%"},{"start":295.28,"duration":5.76,"text":"inaccessible."},{"start":297.8,"duration":7.88,"text":"And some of the more common failures"},{"start":301.04,"duration":6.48,"text":"that we can AI could create, and these"},{"start":305.68,"duration":3.96,"text":"failures actually can pass the"},{"start":307.52,"duration":4.8,"text":"automation checks. Because with"},{"start":309.64,"duration":5.52,"text":"automation, if you use automation tool,"},{"start":312.32,"duration":4.88,"text":"you can catch around 30-40%"},{"start":315.16,"duration":3.96,"text":"for the other things you need to do a"},{"start":317.2,"duration":3.24,"text":"manual testing."},{"start":319.12,"duration":3.36,"text":"So,"},{"start":320.44,"duration":4.72,"text":"here I I list"},{"start":322.48,"duration":5.12,"text":"It will be 10 different issues that"},{"start":325.16,"duration":4.72,"text":"probably could come into the code. So,"},{"start":327.6,"duration":6.64,"text":"div, spans, or other non-interactive"},{"start":329.88,"duration":7.0,"text":"elements with onclick handles um"},{"start":334.24,"duration":6.76,"text":"could be could be used instead of native"},{"start":336.88,"duration":5.24,"text":"button or a elements. And it's very"},{"start":341.0,"duration":2.92,"text":"common"},{"start":342.12,"duration":3.24,"text":"It's very common"},{"start":343.92,"duration":5.52,"text":"error."},{"start":345.36,"duration":7.4,"text":"Um also, AI could add area attributes"},{"start":349.44,"duration":6.36,"text":"redundantly, incorrectly, or in way that"},{"start":352.76,"duration":5.84,"text":"conflict with native semantics."},{"start":355.8,"duration":4.08,"text":"Also, we can get form inputs without"},{"start":358.6,"duration":4.48,"text":"labels,"},{"start":359.88,"duration":5.68,"text":"icon buttons without text alternatives,"},{"start":363.08,"duration":3.8,"text":"and landmarks without distinguishing"},{"start":365.56,"duration":4.04,"text":"names."},{"start":366.88,"duration":5.28,"text":"We can also get unaccessible custom form"},{"start":369.6,"duration":5.64,"text":"controls, but without"},{"start":372.16,"duration":6.64,"text":"uh, without keyboard interaction, area"},{"start":375.24,"duration":6.24,"text":"roles, or state management."},{"start":378.8,"duration":6.04,"text":"We can get components that handle mouse"},{"start":381.48,"duration":6.36,"text":"events, but does not add key- keyboard"},{"start":384.84,"duration":3.0,"text":"equivalents."},{"start":388.08,"duration":4.64,"text":"Another five, modal dialogues,"},{"start":390.64,"duration":4.84,"text":"expandable panels, and single page"},{"start":392.72,"duration":5.48,"text":"navigation that change the visual state"},{"start":395.48,"duration":5.12,"text":"of the page without moving keyboard"},{"start":398.2,"duration":4.88,"text":"focus to the new content."},{"start":400.6,"duration":5.28,"text":"Also, form validation that displays"},{"start":403.08,"duration":5.52,"text":"error messages visually, but does not"},{"start":405.88,"duration":4.56,"text":"programmatically associate them with"},{"start":408.6,"duration":4.52,"text":"their fields."},{"start":410.44,"duration":5.44,"text":"Unaccessible modal dialogues without a"},{"start":413.12,"duration":5.32,"text":"correct area role, without an accessible"},{"start":415.88,"duration":5.64,"text":"name, without focus trapping, and"},{"start":418.44,"duration":6.6,"text":"without an escape key handle."},{"start":421.52,"duration":7.04,"text":"Also, UI components where meaning is"},{"start":425.04,"duration":5.2,"text":"communicated communicated exclusively"},{"start":428.56,"duration":5.52,"text":"through color."},{"start":430.24,"duration":6.96,"text":"And also, unaccessible dynamic contact"},{"start":434.08,"duration":5.92,"text":"content updates."},{"start":437.2,"duration":6.68,"text":"So, the third thing based on"},{"start":440.0,"duration":5.4,"text":"these common failures is"},{"start":443.88,"duration":3.04,"text":"we can,"},{"start":445.4,"duration":4.8,"text":"um,"},{"start":446.92,"duration":6.08,"text":"skip the verification, skip verification"},{"start":450.2,"duration":4.64,"text":"compounds into organizational debt. So,"},{"start":453.0,"duration":3.28,"text":"if you if you have one of these"},{"start":454.84,"duration":3.36,"text":"components,"},{"start":456.28,"duration":5.56,"text":"um,"},{"start":458.2,"duration":6.48,"text":"in in one in one component that can be"},{"start":461.84,"duration":6.08,"text":"reused in several places, you actually"},{"start":464.68,"duration":6.4,"text":"create organizational debt."},{"start":467.92,"duration":6.12,"text":"And the fourth one, AI multiplies"},{"start":471.08,"duration":6.32,"text":"expertise. It doesn't replace it. And"},{"start":474.04,"duration":6.88,"text":"this is my core message. AI is a"},{"start":477.4,"duration":5.84,"text":"productively multiplier for developers"},{"start":480.92,"duration":5.8,"text":"who already understand accessibility"},{"start":483.24,"duration":4.92,"text":"fundamentals. It is not replacement for"},{"start":486.72,"duration":3.68,"text":"learning them."},{"start":488.16,"duration":3.76,"text":"Because without this fundamental"},{"start":490.4,"duration":6.48,"text":"knowledge,"},{"start":491.92,"duration":8.72,"text":"um you cannot evaluate whether you"},{"start":496.88,"duration":6.84,"text":"uh whether AI's output is correct. You"},{"start":500.64,"duration":4.96,"text":"cannot tell if the area row is"},{"start":503.72,"duration":4.24,"text":"misapplied."},{"start":505.6,"duration":3.04,"text":"So, use"},{"start":507.96,"duration":3.6,"text":"um"},{"start":508.64,"duration":5.88,"text":"So, you need foundational knowledge of"},{"start":511.56,"duration":5.88,"text":"accessibility principles to evaluate"},{"start":514.52,"duration":5.56,"text":"whether this AI-generated code is"},{"start":517.44,"duration":7.32,"text":"correct."},{"start":520.08,"duration":7.96,"text":"And expertise in accessibility and AI"},{"start":524.76,"duration":6.4,"text":"can give faster and better outcomes."},{"start":528.04,"duration":7.24,"text":"But gaps in expertise and AI could give"},{"start":531.16,"duration":5.6,"text":"faster code, but bigger mistakes."},{"start":535.28,"duration":3.96,"text":"So,"},{"start":536.76,"duration":4.72,"text":"fast, confident, and wrong."},{"start":539.24,"duration":4.12,"text":"And the cost of being wrong in"},{"start":541.48,"duration":3.92,"text":"accessibility"},{"start":543.36,"duration":3.24,"text":"is exclusion."},{"start":545.4,"duration":4.08,"text":"And"},{"start":546.6,"duration":5.0,"text":"it's about real users who cannot access"},{"start":549.48,"duration":4.56,"text":"your product."},{"start":551.6,"duration":5.28,"text":"And more than 1 billion people have some"},{"start":554.04,"duration":4.08,"text":"sort of disabilities. And this is about"},{"start":556.88,"duration":4.32,"text":"the"},{"start":558.12,"duration":6.04,"text":"permanent one. Because we can also have"},{"start":561.2,"duration":5.88,"text":"temporary, like if you broke your"},{"start":564.16,"duration":6.28,"text":"uh hand, or situational, if you're"},{"start":567.08,"duration":4.4,"text":"holding a baby and you cannot use your"},{"start":570.44,"duration":2.8,"text":"hand"},{"start":571.48,"duration":3.52,"text":"um"},{"start":573.24,"duration":5.0,"text":"uh to"},{"start":575.0,"duration":5.88,"text":"to to to use the product. So, in this"},{"start":578.24,"duration":5.32,"text":"case, verification is not optional when"},{"start":580.88,"duration":4.84,"text":"AI touches accessibility."},{"start":583.56,"duration":4.2,"text":"Because accessibility is a civil and"},{"start":585.72,"duration":6.4,"text":"human right."},{"start":587.76,"duration":10.36,"text":"And from fast, confident, and wrong,"},{"start":592.12,"duration":9.32,"text":"we need fast, verified, and accessible."},{"start":598.12,"duration":6.44,"text":"So, AI will help you move fast, write"},{"start":601.44,"duration":6.44,"text":"code fast, but only verification keeps"},{"start":604.56,"duration":7.04,"text":"you from creating an exclusion."},{"start":607.88,"duration":8.04,"text":"And the last one, trust, but verify, and"},{"start":611.6,"duration":4.32,"text":"know exactly what to verify."},{"start":616.12,"duration":2.6,"text":"Thank you."},{"start":619.64,"duration":3.16,"text":">> [applause]"},{"start":620.